{"name":"Lantana","hex":"#d87273","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Lantana","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A taxonomic genus within the family Verbenaceae – lantanas."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A place in the United States:\nA town in Palm Beach County, Florida. \nAn unincorporated community in Cameron County, Texas. \nA community and census-designated place in Denton County, Texas.","A town in Palm Beach County, Florida."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Lantana"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lantana","blocks":[{"text":"Lantana is a genus of about 150 species of perennial flowering plants in the verbena family, Verbenaceae. They are native to tropical regions of the Americas but exist as an introduced species in numerous areas, especially in the Australian-Pacific region, South and Northeastern part of India. The genus includes both herbaceous plants and shrubs growing to 0.5–2 m (1.6–6.6 ft) tall. Their common names are shrub verbenas or lantanas. The generic name originated in Late Latin, where it refers to the unrelated Viburnum lantana."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/LantanaFlowerLeaves.jpg/330px-LantanaFlowerLeaves.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lantana","wikidata":"Q1096635"},{"title":"Lantana (singer)","blocks":[{"text":"Alba Gárate, better known by her stage name, Lantalba, is a Spanish singer, songwriter, musician, producer and actress, previously known as Lantana. She was born in Barcelona and raised in Fuengirola, Málaga. She moved to Madrid when she was 19 years old to study acting and pursue her musical career. She was signed with EMI/Virgin by 2006 and Rubie Music in 2010. She was nominated to several important Spanish awards, including The 21st Goya Awards, MTV Spain Awards, Televisión Española Awards Album of the Year and The Spanish Music Awards. She currently lives in Berlin, Germany."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Lantalba.jpg/330px-Lantalba.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lantana_(singer)","wikidata":"Q5969959"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Lantana-Violet.jpg/500px-Lantana-Violet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Lantana-Violet.jpg/1280px-Lantana-Violet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Lantana-Violet.jpg/500px-Lantana-Violet.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Lantana Violet color from Arecode, Kerala, India","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALantana-Violet.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Yellow_Lantana_Flower.jpg/500px-Yellow_Lantana_Flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Yellow_Lantana_Flower.jpg/1280px-Yellow_Lantana_Flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Yellow_Lantana_Flower.jpg/500px-Yellow_Lantana_Flower.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Yellow color Lantana flower from Neeleswaram, Kozhikode, Kerala, India","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYellow_Lantana_Flower.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Lantana_Invasion_of_abandoned_citrus_plantation_Sdey_Hemed_Israel.JPG/500px-Lantana_Invasion_of_abandoned_citrus_plantation_Sdey_Hemed_Israel.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikip